+/* RSX_FLASH_DETECT=1 (diag): a 64x36 luminance thumbnail of every presented
+ * frame, compared with its neighbours. A frame unlike both the one before and
+ * the one after, while those two match each other (A-B-A), is a one-frame
+ * flash -- the user's "world vanishes to the skybox" -- and is logged with
+ * its render stats next to its neighbours'. One small blit + readback per
+ * present. */
